== Endometriosis and PCOS Co-occurrence
<sec:fra-endometriosis-pcos>

Endometriosis and polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS) are the two gynaecological conditions patients most often ask about alongside ME/CFS. Their evidentiary status differs sharply: endometriosis has a robust, recent meta-analytic association with ME/CFS, whereas PCOS has essentially no direct evidence. The section treats them separately to avoid conflating a well-supported association with a merely suspected one.

